<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Outboard Marine started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Outboard Marine started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Thursday analyst Bob Hardiman had started coverage of Outboard Marine Corp with a rating of near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the marine engine maker opened unchanged at 13.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
